oup control over when the app is actually needed.\\n\\n**5. Enables environment variable processing:**\\nThe eager options like `--env-file` and `--app` (lines 449-465, 515-528) are processed before app loading, allowing environment variables to be set up properly before the application factory is called. This sequencing would be disrupted if the app loaded during ScriptInfo initialization.\\n\\nThe cached attribute pattern (`_loaded_app: Flask | None = None` initialized in `__init__` at line 331, checked at line 338, and set at line 371) ensures that once loaded, the application instance is reused across multiple calls to `load_app()`, avoiding redundant loading operations while maintaining the flexibility of deferred initialization."}' + '\n')
